    <section class="py-20 bg-slate-50">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-heading font-bold mb-8 text-slate-900 text-center">
            Everything from a single source for your laboratory project
          </h2>
          <div class="prose prose-lg text-gray-600 max-w-none space-y-6">
            <p>
              Delivering a lab container is a complex undertaking that requires expertise across many disciplines. From engineering design through manufacturing and logistics to statutory approvals — every step must be carefully coordinated to achieve an optimal result.
            </p>
            <p>
              At <strong>Planexus</strong> that is exactly what we offer: a single point of contact for every aspect of your laboratory project. Our six core services interlock seamlessly and ensure that your lab container is not only technically sound, but also delivered on time and within budget.
            </p>
            <p>
              What sets us apart from other providers? We do not see ourselves as mere contractors, but as partners who think with you. Our engineers and project managers bring long-standing laboratory-construction experience and know the challenges that arise when delivering a container laboratory. That allows us to identify and resolve issues early — before they become delays or extra cost.
            </p>
            <p>
              Every service references concrete standards: ISO 14644 for cleanrooms, DIN 1946-7 for ventilation, ISO 17025 for testing laboratories, EU-GMP Annex 1 for pharma, TRBA 100/120 for BSL-3, EN 60079 for ATEX and BioStoffV for biological agents. For <a href="/en/industries/pharma-biotech" class="text-primary font-medium hover:underline">pharma and biotech lab containers</a> and <a href="/en/industries/research-universities" class="text-primary font-medium hover:underline">research and university laboratories</a> we deliver sector-specific configurations with complete qualification documentation.
            </p>
            <p>
              Modular laboratory construction follows defined standards: Planexus documents the conformity of every service with a standards reference and test evidence — from design through manufacturing to commissioning. The decentralised control room monitors all container units remotely, regardless of location.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

