                <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4 text-primary shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg> Fume cupboard systems</li>
